{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_07_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_07","title":"背叛","storyCode":"MB-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fa4dbdeea41933f2f3023ac0c7a5eb9fff7933797d4a87fe67c3dba209f8a8d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"越狱开始，然而，到了实施的时间，罗宾却没有出现。而当卡夫卡和安东尼来到主控室，却发现她早已等候多时。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这下终于到实行越狱的环节了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉整个流程虽然略过了一些事情，但还是比我想象的要复杂许多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，我都有些困了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅尔","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我去给大家泡一杯咖啡吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"还差一点就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不过接下来发生的事我也差不多猜到啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"一切准备就绪，只等实行越狱的那一天到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在实行的那一天，有一个人却忽然失踪了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"他们最终决定在监狱停靠在纽莱堡市期间的某一次进入C区清扫的机会进行越狱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那一天约定的时间，罗宾却没有出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们不知道，他们的计划早已被在暗处的杰斯顿完全掌握了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而罗宾，早已经在他们的必经之路上等待着他们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然场面有点混乱，但是姑且跟你确认一下我们的计划！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我们像现在这样，趁打扫囚房的机会进来配合你放倒囚犯和狱警......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我们两个趁着监控那边的狱警还没来得及反应，直接前往顶层启动塔的下沉，然后让监狱断电。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"杜玛已经在地下等着了，只要和她汇合，然后一起进入早就挖好的地道里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"最后换上米娜帮我们偷来的工作人员的服装出去就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直很怀疑，真的有适合我体格的工作人员服装吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"放心放心，杜玛特意帮你重新缝制过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"一件不够那就用两件拼起来嘛，看起来超大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"记得感谢她哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再！见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很兴奋，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，越狱这么好玩的事情，我当然要兴奋了!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，怎么没看到罗宾小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"这次清扫的都是老面孔，就不用我多说了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"是~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，要是我们之中又有要刺杀安东尼老大的怎么办啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为刚才的搜身是干嘛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不信你们空着手能干得过安东尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我看你很想和安东尼先生过过招啊，要打的话喊我一声，我来给你助助威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"滚，没跟你说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么回事，罗宾怎么没来？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，A区的大哥，罗宾人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"B区的别跟我说话......哦，是卡夫卡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，刚才就没找到她，我就是顶替她来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，少废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"A区的跟他，B区的跟我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，没有时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"罗宾，抱歉了啊，要怪只能怪你自己这么紧要的关头不在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......事到如今，也没有回头的路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"以后还能遇到她的话再向她道歉吧，走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是主控室了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，灰尘好多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"罗宾？！为什么你会在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我有备份的卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"备份？你什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"退后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们赶时间，现在没有说话的时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"速战速决吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["赫默"]},{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡","狱警"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["缪尔赛思"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安东尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["罗宾"]}]}
